          "node_type": "item",
          "title": "FAPI / RAR (RFC 9396)",
          "description": ", SD-JWT (RFC 9901), Transaction Tokens and agent extension (implementations: Tokenetes, kontxt, keycloak-tts), Identity and Authorization Chaining Across Domains, Txn-Token Chaining Profile, OAuth Actor Profile, Attenuating Agent Tokens (monotonically-attenuating JWT delegation chains with tool-level argument constraints; offline derivation, no issuer contact), Human Delegation Provenance (HDP) (Ed25519-signed append-only hop chain binding human authorization to agent sessions), DAAP (runtime identity for dynamically-spawned agents), ID-JAG (Identity Assertion JWT Authorization Grant — agent provider signs assertion for cross-domain identity hop; see auth.md for an agent onboarding profile composing ID-JAG with discovery, account linking, client establishment, and delegated access in one click; analysis), CAEP and SSF, JWT Authorization Grants in MCP, Token Exchange in MCP, AWS Bedrock AgentCore OBO token exchange (RFC 8693 / RFC 7523 OBO for agents, also Microsoft EntraID OBO sample)",
